{"id":"a757ce838695243e","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence.md","title":"Reachability Is a Word Congruence","display":"thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence — Reachability Is a Word Congruence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence","aliases":["68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence"],"display":"thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence — Reachability Is a Word Congruence","depends_on":["[[68-df-word-process-reachability]]","[[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§10 p.32 / PDF 41, equivalence and quotient well-definedness argument","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-expansion-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence — Reachability Is a Word Congruence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"833504bc40d11acb\" href=\"?note=833504bc40d11acb\" title=\"68-df-word-process-reachability\">68-df-word-process-reachability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4a73e7703406240\" href=\"?note=b4a73e7703406240\" title=\"68-df-symmetric-word-process\">68-df-symmetric-word-process</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10 p.32 / PDF 41, equivalence and quotient well-definedness argument"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-expansion-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4a73e7703406240\" href=\"?note=b4a73e7703406240\" title=\"68-df-symmetric-word-process\">68-df-symmetric-word-process</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"833504bc40d11acb\" href=\"?note=833504bc40d11acb\" title=\"68-df-word-process-reachability\">68-df-word-process-reachability</a>，词与连接取这些定义的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,X)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,X)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,Z)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Z)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,Z)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Z)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,X&#39;,Y,Y&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,X&#39;)\\land\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,Y&#39;)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X\\,^\\frown Y,X&#39;\\,^\\frown Y&#39;)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X,X&#39;,Y,Y&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,X&#39;)\\land\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,Y&#39;)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X\\,^\\frown Y,X&#39;\\,^\\frown Y&#39;)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10，印刷 p.32 / PDF p.41，先断言对称过程的可达性是等价关系，再据上下文替换证明商乘法与代表元选择无关。这里展开其数学负载：零步路径给自反性；逐步反向给对称性；拼接路径给传递性；给第一条路径右添固定 Y，给第二条路径左添固定 X′，再拼接即得合同性。已阅读原书该段证明并核对上述展开；无机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-word-process-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"833504bc40d11acb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process-reachability]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-symmetric-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"b4a73e7703406240","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-symmetric-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"b4a73e7703406240","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。$\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]，词与连接取这些定义的同一 $\\Omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-word-process-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"833504bc40d11acb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。$\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]，词与连接取这些定义的同一 $\\Omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,X)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,Z)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Z)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall X,X',Y,Y'\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,X')\\land\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Y,Y')\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X\\,^\\frown Y,X'\\,^\\frown Y')\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2096,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a6560d8fe6fe304","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。词与可达性见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]；合同性见 [[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]]。四元组结构与词求值取 [[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]] 的接口。$X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence|thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence — Reachability Is a Word Congruence]]"}],"outgoing":["833504bc40d11acb","b4a73e7703406240"]}